# fixtures/hex/unknown-boot/log.1.hex: store U, created and used by processes in Unknown-boot mode ([OS/proc §5]).
# A Codex thread server without a boot identity claims #1: its Lease record carries an anchor, a deadline and a
# ProcId whose boot_hash is 0 (rule U4); the deadline's mono is 0 ([OS/clock §3.1]), so every checker judges the
# lease by its wall-clock deadline (U3). The anchor names the slot record of unknown-boot/LOCK.hex.

